{
  "_comment": "The PDF placeholder-metadata rule, one table for both halves (nexus-f3yqd). A chunk is a stub when (1) its chunk row metadata holds any non-chunk-row key (DOCUMENT, POSITION or LEGACY of the chunk-metadata key table; 'title' is itself a DOCUMENT key, so a row with only an empty title key is a stub) AND (2) holds no truthy title, AND (3) its owning live document is a PDF (nexus.catalog_source_format = pdf: the extension first, then the catalog content type) whose catalog metadata records no truthy extraction_method. The Python half is nexus.health._pdf_stubs_in_collection (through _is_pdf_stub_metadata and catalog_source_format); the engine half is the SQL of GET /v1/catalog/stub-metadata. tests/catalog/test_pdf_stub_metadata_cases.py runs every case through the client function and CatalogStubMetadataParityTest runs every case through the route, each in a collection of its own; a change to either rule that the other does not follow fails one of the two. 'document' is the owning catalog document (content_type, file_path, source_uri, meta = its metadata object); 'chunk' is the chunk row's metadata; 'expect.stub' is whether that one chunk counts as a stub; 'expect.source' is the name the client counts it under (source_uri, else file_path, else 'content_hash ' + the first 12 characters of the chunk's content_hash, or '?'), null when the chunk is not a stub. Python falsiness is the rule for title and extraction_method: absent, null, false, 0, 0.0, \"\", [] and {} are all 'no value'. Values stay in forms a jsonb round trip leaves alone.",
  "cases": [
    {"id": "stub-empty-title-with-document-key", "document": {"content_type": "pdf", "file_path": "/a/p1.pdf", "source_uri": "file:///a/p1.pdf", "meta": {}}, "chunk": {"title": "", "content_hash": "c1"}, "expect": {"stub": true, "source": "file:///a/p1.pdf"}},
    {"id": "stub-no-title-key", "document": {"content_type": "pdf", "file_path": "/a/p2.pdf", "source_uri": "file:///a/p2.pdf", "meta": {}}, "chunk": {"content_hash": "c2"}, "expect": {"stub": true, "source": "file:///a/p2.pdf"}},
    {"id": "stub-title-null", "document": {"content_type": "pdf", "file_path": "/a/p3.pdf", "source_uri": "file:///a/p3.pdf", "meta": {}}, "chunk": {"title": null, "page_number": 3}, "expect": {"stub": true, "source": "file:///a/p3.pdf"}},
    {"id": "stub-title-false", "document": {"content_type": "pdf", "file_path": "/a/p4.pdf", "source_uri": "file:///a/p4.pdf", "meta": {}}, "chunk": {"title": false, "line_start": 1}, "expect": {"stub": true, "source": "file:///a/p4.pdf"}},
    {"id": "stub-title-zero", "document": {"content_type": "pdf", "file_path": "/a/p5.pdf", "source_uri": "file:///a/p5.pdf", "meta": {}}, "chunk": {"title": 0, "line_start": 1}, "expect": {"stub": true, "source": "file:///a/p5.pdf"}},
    {"id": "stub-title-zero-float", "document": {"content_type": "pdf", "file_path": "/a/p6.pdf", "source_uri": "file:///a/p6.pdf", "meta": {}}, "chunk": {"title": 0.0, "line_start": 1}, "expect": {"stub": true, "source": "file:///a/p6.pdf"}},
    {"id": "stub-title-empty-list", "document": {"content_type": "pdf", "file_path": "/a/p7.pdf", "source_uri": "file:///a/p7.pdf", "meta": {}}, "chunk": {"title": [], "section_type": "body"}, "expect": {"stub": true, "source": "file:///a/p7.pdf"}},
    {"id": "stub-title-empty-object", "document": {"content_type": "pdf", "file_path": "/a/p8.pdf", "source_uri": "file:///a/p8.pdf", "meta": {}}, "chunk": {"title": {}, "section_type": "body"}, "expect": {"stub": true, "source": "file:///a/p8.pdf"}},
    {"id": "not-stub-title-text", "document": {"content_type": "pdf", "file_path": "/a/p9.pdf", "source_uri": "file:///a/p9.pdf", "meta": {}}, "chunk": {"title": "A Paper", "content_hash": "c9"}, "expect": {"stub": false, "source": null}},
    {"id": "not-stub-title-blank-text", "document": {"content_type": "pdf", "file_path": "/a/p10.pdf", "source_uri": "file:///a/p10.pdf", "meta": {}}, "chunk": {"title": " ", "content_hash": "c10"}, "expect": {"stub": false, "source": null}},
    {"id": "not-stub-title-string-zero", "document": {"content_type": "pdf", "file_path": "/a/p11.pdf", "source_uri": "file:///a/p11.pdf", "meta": {}}, "chunk": {"title": "0", "content_hash": "c11"}, "expect": {"stub": false, "source": null}},
    {"id": "not-stub-title-true", "document": {"content_type": "pdf", "file_path": "/a/p12.pdf", "source_uri": "file:///a/p12.pdf", "meta": {}}, "chunk": {"title": true, "content_hash": "c12"}, "expect": {"stub": false, "source": null}},
    {"id": "not-stub-title-number", "document": {"content_type": "pdf", "file_path": "/a/p13.pdf", "source_uri": "file:///a/p13.pdf", "meta": {}}, "chunk": {"title": 7, "content_hash": "c13"}, "expect": {"stub": false, "source": null}},
    {"id": "not-stub-title-nonempty-list", "document": {"content_type": "pdf", "file_path": "/a/p14.pdf", "source_uri": "file:///a/p14.pdf", "meta": {}}, "chunk": {"title": ["x"], "content_hash": "c14"}, "expect": {"stub": false, "source": null}},
    {"id": "not-stub-title-nonempty-object", "document": {"content_type": "pdf", "file_path": "/a/p15.pdf", "source_uri": "file:///a/p15.pdf", "meta": {}}, "chunk": {"title": {"a": 1}, "content_hash": "c15"}, "expect": {"stub": false, "source": null}},
